.next/
# Local runtime state only. `app-store.json` holds real user rows (phone numbers
# and ids), so the directory contents stay out of version control.
#
# `data/*` rather than `data/` on purpose: excluding the *directory* makes git
# skip it entirely, and a later `!` negation can never re-include a file whose
# parent was excluded. Ignoring each entry instead keeps the directory walkable
# so the exception below works.
data/*
# …but the workshop directory is real application content. `components/ui/
# workshops-map.tsx` imports it, and because it used to be ignored the build
# passed locally (the file was on disk) and failed on Vercel with
# "Module not found: Can't resolve '@/data/workshops'". Tracked from now on.
!data/workshops.ts
*.tsbuildinfo
.DS_Store
.clerk/

# 🚨 Local probe/scratch files. These routinely carry live credentials
# (Supabase keys, tokens) written by ad-hoc verification scripts — one was
# created on 2026-10-03 with a real secret key inside. Never commit them.
.tmp-*
tmp-*
scripts/probe-*.mjs
cdp-profile/
.cdp-profile/

.vercel
.env*

# «الخط السعودي» — Ministry of Culture font, placed here manually for a trial.
# Not used by the app (the typeface is Alexandria), and its EULA §3 forbids
# redistributing the font files or shipping them as part of a software package,
# so it must never be committed.
الخط السعودي/
